WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.029
Here’s how to find a gravesite at Forest Lake
Memorial Park using GraveNav.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:11.419
Open Search and enter a name or plot
reference. We’ll look up Fernando Kuwento.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:18.869
Check the name and plot reference in the
results. Then select View Memorial on the
matching card.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:25.114
On Fernando’s memorial, select Navigate to
Gravesite to open the park map.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:32.094
Use the garden, block, and lot to confirm the
gravesite you’re looking for.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:39.109
To start from a landmark, choose a starting
point like the Main Entrance, then tap Get
Directions.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:47.189
Open View Route Steps to see the walking
directions. Check the highlighted route before
you start walking.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:56.704
On your phone, tap Use My Current Location. If
your browser asks, allow location access for
GraveNav.

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:04.049
Inside the park, live GPS updates your route
as you walk. This example uses a simulated
location.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:10.334
To explore the gardens, landmarks, or
pathways, open Map from the main menu.
